# Project focus: game demo / prototype

Despite the folder name (`Blender-Test01`) and leftover `.blend` files, **this project is the interactive game demo/prototype**, not Blender modeling work.

## Primary codebase

- **Official name**: Tank U
- **Repo**: https://github.com/stellanjoh2/TankU
- **Main app**: `proto/` — Vite + Three.js + Rapier
- Gameplay lives in `proto/src/` (tank, planes, terrain, AI, HUD, SFX, etc.)
- When the user asks to add features, fix bugs, or "work on the project," default to the **proto game**, not Blender scripts or MCP Blender tools

## Assets vs gameplay

- Blender files, `scripts/`, `exports/`, and texture pipelines are **asset/tooling support** for the prototype
- Only touch Blender/asset pipelines when the user explicitly asks for modeling, export, rigging, or bake work

## Defaults

- Prefer changing `proto/src/` for gameplay, visuals, controls, and systems
- Do not assume Blender MCP / scene editing unless they clearly want 3D asset work
